{"toolCallId":"call_26c17aa9e4bf49ce9c160572944edd14","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"65:argv enters the parse loop and sets `LOC`, `FILES`, the risk flags, `RECOMMEND_PHASES`, `PHASE_THRESHOLD`, `JSON_OUTPUT` and the new `QUIET`. Validation rejects bad input on stderr before any scoring. The scoring pipeline fills `TOTAL_SCORE`, `RECOMMENDED_LEVEL`, `LEVEL_NAME`, `CONFIDENCE` and the phase fields. The dispatch at section 7 then selects JSON, quiet or text. stdout carries the selected output only, stderr carries every diagnostic, and the exit code is `0` on success or `1` on user error.\n200:- No monitoring surface: the script writes to stdout and stderr only.\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w904a7ae601/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"834d37","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
