ne/002-gem-team-adoption/001-typed-agent-io-adapter/tasks.md:74:- [x] T014 Wired the `AGENT_IO_DISPATCH` header onto the four Step 5 `@context` dispatches in `speckit_plan_auto.yaml`.\nspecs/system-speckit/027-xce-research-based-refinement/001-research-and-doctrine/002-gem-team-adoption/001-typed-agent-io-adapter/tasks.md:75:- [x] T015 Wired the `AGENT_IO_DISPATCH` header onto the four Step 5 `@context` dispatches in `speckit_plan_confirm.yaml`.\nspecs/system-speckit/027-xce-research-based-refinement/001-research-and-doctrine/002-gem-team-adoption/001-typed-agent-io-adapter/tasks.md:76:- [x] T016 Added the small optional/advisory contract pointer to `AGENTS.md`; Four Laws and Gates text unchanged.\nspecs/system-speckit/027-xce-research-based-refinement/001-research-and-doctrine/002-gem-team-adoption/001-typed-agent-io-adapter/tasks.md:84:- [x] T017 Verified the contract doc exists with all fields optional, the header/envelope defined, and the numeric-to-band mapping present and band-derived.\nspecs/system-speckit/027-xce-research-based-refinement/001-research-and-doctrine/002-gem-team-adoption/001-typed-agent-io-adapter/tasks.md:85:- [x] T018 Grep-verified `@code`'s first-line `RETURN:` and `@context`'s six required sections survive; both plan YAMLs show the header on all four planning dispatches; `@orchestrate` documents the envelope-less degrade path; AGENTS keeps the Four Laws and Gate 3 headings with only the pointer added.\nspecs/system-speckit/027-xce-research-based-refinement/001-research-and-doctrine/002-gem-team-adoption/001-typed-agent-io-adapter/tasks.md:86:- [x] T019 Run `bash .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/spec/validate.sh .opencode/specs/system-spec-kit/027-xce-research-based-refinement/001-research-and-doctrine/002-gem-team-adoption/001-typed-agent-io-adapter --strict`. — PASSED (exit 0, Errors 0 / Warnings 0, 2026-06-10; reproduced by Fable verifier).\nspecs/system-speckit/050-open-knowledge-format-adoption/008-context-type-hardening/tasks.